 "version": 1,
 "title": "Stores across Europe on a map and in a list",
 "prompt": "Make a store locator for our eight stores across Europe: numbered markers on a map, and a list of the stores with the address and the rating. On a phone the map on top and the list below; on a wide screen the list in a side panel. Tapping a store in the list highlights its marker, and tapping a marker selects the store.",
 "level": 2,
 "family": "CMP",
