 ],
 "teaches": [
  "One MapList call: each store is {title, subtitle: address, meta: rating, metaIcon: \"star\", place: a city or \"lon,lat\", label}. About 2.5 KB of JSON for the whole adaptive screen",
  "The map frames the eight places by itself (WorldMap fit), with country borders; Copenhagen is not in the city list, so its place is \"12.57,55.68\"",
  "label gives each row a spoken line with what the row leaves out (today's hours)",
  "A row tap and a marker tap set the same @sel: the row gets a tint and a bar, the marker grows with a halo"
 ],
